(7098188, 1081779, 138630, '<td valign="top">The stand-out image for me - I like almost everything about it (the background is a bit too dark - I''m really having trouble making it out and that''s too bad).  I like the lighting on the daydreaming boy, the writing on the board and tie with the title, the relative darkness of the background (just not quite so much), the grain, and the tones.  Very nice.  10</td>', 'The stand-out image for me - I like almost everything about it (the background is a bit too dark - I''m really having trouble making it out and that''s too bad).  I like the lighting on the daydreaming boy, the writing on the board and tie with the title, the relative darkness of the background (just not quite so much), the grain, and the tones.  Very nice.  10', '2013-09-04 12:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
